WEBVTT

01:21.360 --> 01:26.610
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.400 --> 01:29.680
[Episode 34]

01:30.039 --> 01:30.640
If it weren't for you,

01:30.640 --> 01:32.700
we would have been together long ago!

01:33.200 --> 01:35.000
Chen Xuanqing, you're insane!

01:35.150 --> 01:36.080
Yes, I am insane!

01:41.350 --> 01:42.550
The moment I found out

01:43.229 --> 01:44.350
you were going to marry him,

01:44.350 --> 01:45.509
I went insane!

01:48.479 --> 01:49.229
Chen Yanyun,

01:50.350 --> 01:51.759
you sit up high

01:52.120 --> 01:53.350
with absolute power.

01:54.950 --> 01:57.070
But you're just a hypocrite.

01:57.680 --> 01:59.140
You said you took pity on me

01:59.680 --> 02:01.400
and brought me to the Chen family,

02:01.400 --> 02:02.640
but you only thought I had a bright future

02:02.640 --> 02:04.640
and could be of use to your Chen family!

02:04.640 --> 02:06.430
Yet you couldn't bear to see me soar,

02:06.430 --> 02:09.030
so you manipulate and control me
at every turn!

02:10.400 --> 02:12.430
You knew full well that Jinzhao and I
were in love,

02:12.430 --> 02:13.680
yet you deliberately arranged a marriage

02:13.680 --> 02:15.080
for me with the Yu family.

02:15.850 --> 02:17.380
You claimed to worry about my background

02:17.380 --> 02:18.180
and my future.

02:18.630 --> 02:19.470
You did all this

02:19.470 --> 02:21.000
just to steal Jinzhao away!

02:26.240 --> 02:27.240
Nonsense.

02:28.310 --> 02:30.240
This is all your imagination.

02:30.800 --> 02:31.470
Is it?

02:34.840 --> 02:36.040
Is it my imagination,

02:36.960 --> 02:38.470
or are you under his spell?

02:41.630 --> 02:42.430
Dare you deny

02:42.430 --> 02:43.760
that you used to like me?

02:44.470 --> 02:45.310
You went to

02:45.750 --> 02:46.470
great lengths

02:46.470 --> 02:48.270
to get close to me at the Academy.

02:48.310 --> 02:49.400
Even when you were beaten by Ye Xian,

02:49.400 --> 02:50.360
you endured it.

02:51.590 --> 02:52.400
I've read all the letters

02:52.400 --> 02:53.260
you wrote to me.

02:53.680 --> 02:54.310
I wrote,

02:54.630 --> 02:56.430
"As a wanderer, my heart is full of
a hundred woes.

02:56.430 --> 02:58.960
I've roamed a thousand miles away
all alone."

02:58.960 --> 02:59.750
You said you also had

02:59.750 --> 03:00.750
this feeling of being a stranger at home,

03:00.750 --> 03:02.680
and told me not to be too depressed.

03:02.910 --> 03:03.470
You understand me so well.

03:03.470 --> 03:05.130
Dare you say you don't like me?

03:12.030 --> 03:13.290
That day on the bridge,

03:13.710 --> 03:14.560
I went,

03:15.680 --> 03:16.710
and I also saw the kite

03:16.710 --> 03:17.590
you flew for me.

03:17.750 --> 03:18.480
Did you know?

03:20.030 --> 03:21.030
You're too naive,

03:21.840 --> 03:23.840
that's why you were deceived by him.

03:23.960 --> 03:25.190
He has always played political games,

03:25.190 --> 03:26.560
and is best at manipulating people.

03:26.560 --> 03:27.310
What you see

03:27.310 --> 03:28.430
is only what he wants you to see!

03:28.430 --> 03:29.470
Shut up!

03:32.000 --> 03:33.120
I'll kill you!

03:34.150 --> 03:35.680
-Third Master!
-Third Master!

03:35.680 --> 03:37.280
-Third Master!
-Let go of me!

03:37.800 --> 03:38.680
Third Master!

03:58.750 --> 03:59.550
Throw him out!

04:00.150 --> 04:00.590
Yes!

04:22.630 --> 04:24.020
I did nothing wrong.

04:24.120 --> 04:24.630
Get up.

04:32.630 --> 04:34.430
You can't be mad at me because of
what happened

04:34.430 --> 04:35.360
in the past.

05:02.920 --> 05:04.780
I want to be calm and rational too，

05:05.430 --> 05:06.000
but I...

05:08.560 --> 05:10.310
I can't do it right now.

05:22.950 --> 05:24.040
Leave me alone.

05:29.270 --> 05:30.300
Chen Jiuheng!

05:30.460 --> 05:31.630
If you leave,

05:32.390 --> 05:34.190
you're not allowed to come back!

06:02.310 --> 06:03.510
Is what you said true?

06:04.830 --> 06:06.240
How would I know if it's true or not?

06:06.240 --> 06:07.840
I heard it from my fourth son.

06:08.680 --> 06:09.540
He said his wife

06:09.600 --> 06:11.000
became a completely different person

06:11.000 --> 06:13.120
after coming back from the Chen family.

06:13.120 --> 06:14.240
She kept saying

06:14.630 --> 06:15.630
that Third Mr. Chen

06:15.630 --> 06:17.240
wants to avenge her father.

06:17.630 --> 06:20.290
But where would Third Mr. Chen
get the evidence?

06:20.750 --> 06:22.230
When I executed Yanhong,

06:22.270 --> 06:24.200
I couldn't have been more careful.

06:29.160 --> 06:30.240
Regardless,

06:31.070 --> 06:33.270
Yuanweng, you should make plans early.

06:33.430 --> 06:35.090
This matter is no small thing.

06:35.159 --> 06:36.390
If it gets exposed,

06:37.159 --> 06:38.860
all of your ambitions

06:39.070 --> 06:40.560
will go down the drain.

06:41.430 --> 06:42.960
What are you talking about?

06:43.040 --> 06:44.630
If our Master's plans are ruined,

06:44.630 --> 06:46.760
do you think you'd gain any advantage?

06:48.630 --> 06:49.960
Why are you stopping me?

06:53.070 --> 06:54.920
Third Mr. Chen knows about Yanhong.

06:54.920 --> 06:55.560
What?

06:56.560 --> 06:57.040
Who?

06:57.680 --> 06:58.300
The woman that

06:58.300 --> 07:00.430
Prince Chengqing gave to me back then.

07:00.950 --> 07:03.210
Wasn't she thrown into the Tongfu River?

07:03.270 --> 07:04.310
It's been so many years.

07:04.310 --> 07:05.240
How did they know?

07:05.240 --> 07:06.510
How should I know?

07:07.270 --> 07:08.560
This is too scary.

07:09.160 --> 07:09.630
This...

07:10.240 --> 07:10.700
This...

07:11.040 --> 07:12.800
Master, what should we do?

07:15.000 --> 07:15.750
Calm down.

07:17.240 --> 07:18.600
I wasn't the only one

07:18.600 --> 07:20.160
who colluded with Prince Chengqing.

07:20.160 --> 07:21.960
Even if they find out something,

07:22.000 --> 07:24.060
the Senior Grand Secretary knows me.

07:25.070 --> 07:26.530
If it really comes to that,

07:27.480 --> 07:28.630
I, Wang Xuanfan,

07:29.360 --> 07:31.490
am not afraid to burn everything down.

07:35.600 --> 07:36.190
Someone!

07:38.270 --> 07:38.800
Master.

07:39.240 --> 07:40.800
Send some men to keep a close watch
on Third Mr. Chen.

07:40.800 --> 07:42.000
If there's any sign of trouble,

07:42.000 --> 07:43.120
report back immediately.

07:43.120 --> 07:43.560
Yes.

07:43.830 --> 07:44.290
Also...

07:45.830 --> 07:47.159
We previously suspected Third Mr. Chen

07:47.159 --> 07:48.630
of colluding with the river bandits
back then.

07:48.630 --> 07:49.680
Investigate this matter

07:49.680 --> 07:50.740
thoroughly again.

07:51.120 --> 07:52.450
And that Chen Xuanqing.

07:52.830 --> 07:53.560
I remember

07:53.580 --> 07:54.600
he was adopted

07:54.600 --> 07:55.560
from Xuzhou Prefecture.

07:55.560 --> 07:57.600
He might very well be connected
to the river bandits.

07:57.600 --> 07:58.680
Investigate it carefully.

07:58.680 --> 07:59.720
Investigate it ruthlessly.

07:59.720 --> 08:01.320
We must find solid evidence.

08:01.750 --> 08:02.270
Yes.

08:29.410 --> 08:31.200
♪ Once I wrote of spring and fall ♪

08:31.810 --> 08:34.850
♪ Yet fell through time's abyss ♪

08:37.190 --> 08:38.659
♪ Every shade turned bitter ♪

08:39.220 --> 08:42.230
♪ Every longing became sorrow ♪

08:44.690 --> 08:46.500
♪ I've seen through right and wrong ♪

08:47.380 --> 08:50.760
♪ Old vows washed away like ash ♪

08:51.480 --> 08:57.920
♪ True devotion is knowing
the freedom within your heart♪

08:58.730 --> 09:01.610
♪ Word by word, hand in hand ♪

09:02.390 --> 09:05.620
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

09:06.150 --> 09:09.410
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

09:10.360 --> 09:12.720
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

09:14.410 --> 09:17.360
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

09:18.160 --> 09:21.120
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

09:22.000 --> 09:29.250
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

09:58.510 --> 09:59.510
Hurry, Mr. Jiang!

09:59.960 --> 10:00.480
Hurry!

10:00.840 --> 10:01.360
Hurry, Mr. Jiang!

10:01.360 --> 10:02.240
What exactly happened to Third Master?

10:02.240 --> 10:03.390
You didn't see the state he was in.

10:03.390 --> 10:04.790
Something is really wrong!

10:04.790 --> 10:05.270
What kind of state?

10:05.270 --> 10:06.120
I can't describe it!

10:06.120 --> 10:07.850
Just... come see for yourself!

10:08.240 --> 10:08.770
Let's go.

10:09.080 --> 10:09.790
Hurry up!

10:10.840 --> 10:11.510
Slow down!

10:11.510 --> 10:13.310
Third Master, Mr. Jiang is here!

10:15.630 --> 10:16.960
Third Master, you...

10:25.720 --> 10:26.520
Third Master.

10:28.030 --> 10:29.120
Wang Xuanfan

10:29.630 --> 10:30.910
has made a move as expected.

10:30.910 --> 10:31.910
Not only did he send several people

10:31.910 --> 10:32.710
to follow you,

10:33.030 --> 10:34.910
but he also made contact with the bandits

10:34.910 --> 10:36.310
in Zhending Prefecture.

10:41.510 --> 10:42.550
Go on.

10:47.320 --> 10:48.080
Normally,

10:48.870 --> 10:49.600
our plan

10:49.600 --> 10:50.840
can proceed as usual.

10:51.120 --> 10:51.790
But if

10:53.260 --> 10:54.440
you want to postpone it...

10:54.440 --> 10:55.570
No need to postpone.

10:55.960 --> 10:57.480
Just proceed as planned.

10:58.670 --> 10:59.120
Okay.

11:05.550 --> 11:07.000
Um, Third Master,

11:07.270 --> 11:08.360
Qingpu

11:08.670 --> 11:09.550
came to see me.

11:12.750 --> 11:14.390
What did she want to see you about?

11:14.390 --> 11:15.630
Qingpu said

11:16.150 --> 11:18.390
she wants you to return home
and see Madam.

11:18.390 --> 11:19.000
She said

11:19.440 --> 11:21.270
Madam has been waiting for you all day,

11:21.270 --> 11:22.510
not eating, not drinking,

11:22.510 --> 11:23.510
and not sleeping.

11:31.200 --> 11:32.600
She wouldn't stop eating and drinking

11:32.600 --> 11:33.390
for me.

11:34.000 --> 11:35.360
You haven't gone back to check.

11:35.360 --> 11:35.790
How...

11:35.870 --> 11:36.930
How would you know?

11:37.120 --> 11:38.240
I know

11:38.240 --> 11:39.900
I shouldn't speak out of turn.

11:40.320 --> 11:41.180
But this matter

11:41.480 --> 11:43.080
really isn't Madam's fault.

11:43.320 --> 11:44.440
Madam has been

11:44.870 --> 11:46.080
hiding from Young Master Xuanqing
these days,

11:46.080 --> 11:47.790
staying out of his way whenever possible.

11:47.790 --> 11:49.720
It's Chen Xuanqing who insists...

11:50.270 --> 11:51.600
Insists on forcing her,

11:52.320 --> 11:52.910
right?

11:56.150 --> 11:56.750
Yes.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.240
Young Master.

12:11.960 --> 12:12.490
Please..

12:13.550 --> 12:15.080
Please say something!

12:16.960 --> 12:17.490
Let me...

12:17.600 --> 12:19.060
Let me pour you some water.

12:41.150 --> 12:42.870
I have already written to the Yu family.

12:42.870 --> 12:43.840
Your engagement to Wanxue

12:43.840 --> 12:44.970
is hereby annulled.

12:47.030 --> 12:48.960
You will be sent out of the capital.

12:50.600 --> 12:51.320
You can't.

12:56.520 --> 12:57.600
You can't do this.

12:59.600 --> 13:01.730
I got Third Place in the Imperial Exam.

13:03.960 --> 13:05.220
You can't send me away.

13:06.270 --> 13:07.930
If I hadn't intervened today,

13:08.360 --> 13:09.630
given your impulsive and extreme nature

13:09.630 --> 13:10.810
and your character,

13:11.000 --> 13:11.750
Jinzhao

13:12.270 --> 13:14.000
would likely have been ruined.

13:14.550 --> 13:17.030
The Chen family would have been disgraced
as well.

13:17.030 --> 13:17.910
I won't let you

13:17.910 --> 13:19.510
stay in the capital anymore.

13:19.600 --> 13:20.730
Go to the provinces.

13:21.030 --> 13:21.910
If you can

13:22.600 --> 13:24.860
serve as an official steadfastly there,

13:25.720 --> 13:28.580
perhaps I might still think
somewhat highly of you.

13:31.790 --> 13:32.520
Third Uncle!

13:33.000 --> 13:33.730
Third Uncle!

13:34.270 --> 13:34.940
I was wrong!

13:35.750 --> 13:37.480
I was truly wrong, Third Uncle!

13:40.840 --> 13:41.570
Third Uncle!

13:44.720 --> 13:46.520
I have studied for so many years.

13:48.120 --> 13:49.580
I am a palace graduate,

13:49.720 --> 13:51.270
a compiler at the Hanlin Academy.

13:51.270 --> 13:53.130
His Majesty also appreciates me.

13:53.630 --> 13:54.360
Third Uncle!

13:55.960 --> 13:56.690
Third Uncle!

13:57.030 --> 13:58.290
You can't send me away.

13:59.550 --> 14:00.280
Third Uncle!

14:02.790 --> 14:03.750
Wang Xuanfan

14:04.320 --> 14:07.150
is already investigating
your biological father.

14:07.150 --> 14:08.510
Making you leave the capital

14:08.510 --> 14:09.910
is also for your own good.

14:11.150 --> 14:12.410
Take care of yourself.

14:21.750 --> 14:22.550
Young Master!

14:24.480 --> 14:25.280
Young Master!

14:27.840 --> 14:28.640
Young Master!

14:28.840 --> 14:29.640
Young Master!

14:40.510 --> 14:42.550
Why do you think Third Master
is doing this?

14:42.550 --> 14:44.120
He clearly cares deeply about Madam,

14:44.120 --> 14:45.600
yet he is still being so stubborn.

14:45.600 --> 14:46.270
Besides,

14:46.440 --> 14:47.240
this matter really

14:47.240 --> 14:48.360
isn't Madam's fault.

14:48.360 --> 14:49.910
It's all Chen Xuanqing's fault.

14:49.910 --> 14:50.870
The matter is over,

14:50.870 --> 14:53.200
yet he insists on digging it up
and asking for trouble.

14:53.200 --> 14:54.030
Do you think Third Master

14:54.030 --> 14:56.030
doesn't know that Madam is innocent?

14:56.030 --> 14:56.840
He just can't

14:56.840 --> 14:58.200
get over it himself.

14:56.880 --> 14:58.510
[Everything is properly prepared.

14:58.510 --> 15:00.140
We can proceed once we leave the capital
the day after tomorrow]

14:58.870 --> 15:00.470
What... What does that mean?

15:03.480 --> 15:04.550
Think about it.

15:04.960 --> 15:06.290
In Third Master's life,

15:06.550 --> 15:09.390
whether facing treacherous
and unpredictable Court

15:09.390 --> 15:11.790
or the harsh realities
of the martial world,

15:11.790 --> 15:14.120
he has experienced countless hardships.

15:15.440 --> 15:17.150
However, romantic love

15:17.270 --> 15:19.000
is completely new to him.

15:19.910 --> 15:21.630
And romantic love

15:21.960 --> 15:23.320
is the most inexplicable

15:23.320 --> 15:24.650
and complicated thing.

15:25.670 --> 15:27.000
Yet our Third Master

15:27.000 --> 15:28.670
has extremely high standards

15:29.320 --> 15:31.150
and is reserved when facing problems.

15:31.150 --> 15:32.240
So with all this back and forth,

15:32.240 --> 15:33.570
he becomes conflicted.

15:37.240 --> 15:38.040
I don't get it.

15:43.790 --> 15:45.000
Just remember,

15:45.150 --> 15:47.240
Third Master not returning home right now

15:47.240 --> 15:49.300
is also to spare Madam from worrying.

15:49.540 --> 15:50.270
After all,

15:50.840 --> 15:52.080
this plan of ours

15:52.270 --> 15:54.670
was kept a secret from Madam as well.

16:04.790 --> 16:08.290
[Linxia Restaurant]

16:07.360 --> 16:08.550
It's been a few days.

16:08.960 --> 16:11.290
Why hasn't brother-in-law returned yet?

16:13.240 --> 16:15.240
Can we not talk about this nonsense?

16:15.720 --> 16:17.920
I heard you caught a chill a few days ago.

16:19.200 --> 16:21.240
Your complexion still doesn't look good.

16:21.240 --> 16:22.910
You should rest well at home.

16:23.240 --> 16:24.570
Why did you have to come?

16:25.870 --> 16:26.960
Some matters

16:28.120 --> 16:30.580
should be settled
sooner rather than later.

16:31.200 --> 16:32.030
It's better

16:32.550 --> 16:33.950
to do it here than at home.

16:37.120 --> 16:38.080
Sister Jinzhao.

16:40.960 --> 16:42.290
What exactly happened?

16:42.390 --> 16:44.590
Why suddenly break off the engagement?

16:54.790 --> 16:55.320
Sit down.

17:00.790 --> 17:01.550
What did

17:02.270 --> 17:03.470
your father tell you?

17:04.000 --> 17:05.960
Father only said there would be
no marriage.

17:05.960 --> 17:06.720
He didn't say

17:07.109 --> 17:09.040
a single word about anything else.

17:09.480 --> 17:11.220
I went to see Xuanqing once,

17:11.440 --> 17:12.770
but he refused to see me.

17:13.109 --> 17:14.480
Father found out later

17:14.480 --> 17:15.589
and scolded me.

17:16.160 --> 17:18.310
He forbade me from seeing Xuanqing again.

17:18.310 --> 17:20.550
If you hadn't sent someone
to pick me up today,

17:20.550 --> 17:22.609
Father wouldn't have allowed me out.

17:23.400 --> 17:24.829
I asked you here today

17:25.480 --> 17:26.680
because I wanted

17:26.880 --> 17:29.210
to explain this matter to you
face to face.

17:29.440 --> 17:30.830
You heard

17:31.030 --> 17:32.560
what Xuanqing said that day

17:32.680 --> 17:33.810
at Lan's residence.

17:35.070 --> 17:36.070
After weighing the pros and cons,

17:36.070 --> 17:36.960
Third Master,

17:37.240 --> 17:38.510
your father, and I

17:39.680 --> 17:41.140
feel that you and Xuanqing

17:41.440 --> 17:42.570
are not a good match.

17:49.240 --> 17:50.200
It's you!

17:51.200 --> 17:53.360
The person in Xuanqing's heart...

17:53.830 --> 17:55.110
It's you, isn't it?

18:05.920 --> 18:07.980
I actually guessed it a long time ago.

18:09.590 --> 18:10.840
That day, Xuanqing

18:10.890 --> 18:12.550
seemed to be talking to me.

18:14.880 --> 18:17.540
But he was clearly looking at you
the whole time.

18:18.880 --> 18:19.830
I knew then

18:21.290 --> 18:23.190
he wasn't being honest with me.

18:24.750 --> 18:25.880
He was using me

18:25.880 --> 18:27.610
to express his feelings to you.

18:28.680 --> 18:30.880
That's why the engagement was broken off.

18:30.880 --> 18:31.590
Wanxue,

18:32.680 --> 18:33.480
you should find someone

18:33.480 --> 18:35.280
who knows you, understands you,

18:35.510 --> 18:37.310
-and truly loves you.
-What's the use of saying

18:37.310 --> 18:38.310
these things now?

18:39.960 --> 18:41.640
I clearly told you

18:42.400 --> 18:45.030
that I've had feelings for Xuanqing
since we were little.

18:45.030 --> 18:46.050
I even said

18:46.110 --> 18:46.920
that no matter what,

18:46.920 --> 18:48.450
I'd be willing to marry him.

18:48.880 --> 18:49.680
And you have already

18:49.680 --> 18:50.920
married Third Uncle.

18:51.480 --> 18:52.240
Why did you have to

18:52.240 --> 18:53.680
expose all of this?

18:54.680 --> 18:56.680
Couldn't we just live our own lives?

18:56.920 --> 18:58.320
Wouldn't that be better?

18:58.680 --> 18:59.480
You can't

18:59.480 --> 19:00.480
knowingly

19:00.920 --> 19:02.310
jump into a fire pit.

19:06.310 --> 19:08.200
Do you still have feelings for Xuanqing?

19:08.200 --> 19:09.000
Of course not.

19:09.550 --> 19:10.270
Then could you

19:10.270 --> 19:11.380
talk to Uncle Chen

19:11.920 --> 19:13.240
and ask him not to
call off the engagement?

19:13.240 --> 19:13.830
No.

19:15.400 --> 19:16.480
Xuanqing will soon

19:16.720 --> 19:17.880
be transferred away,

19:17.880 --> 19:19.680
and won't return to the capital.

19:20.590 --> 19:21.520
Just forget him.

19:42.700 --> 19:45.460
[Letter of Amicable Separation]

19:46.790 --> 19:47.650
Are you willing

19:48.640 --> 19:49.680
to be with me?

19:50.790 --> 19:52.390
When we encounter a problem,

19:52.510 --> 19:54.240
don't be in a hurry to back down.

19:55.230 --> 19:56.230
Let's see if we can

19:56.270 --> 19:57.950
come up with a better way

19:58.440 --> 19:59.310
to solve it.

20:00.400 --> 20:01.640
You once said

20:02.240 --> 20:03.590
we'd face things

20:03.640 --> 20:05.040
and solve them together.

20:05.790 --> 20:06.790
And now?

20:14.710 --> 20:16.570
I want to be calm and rational too,

20:17.130 --> 20:17.940
but I...

20:37.960 --> 20:39.510
Since you are hiding

20:39.530 --> 20:40.990
and avoiding me like this,

20:41.830 --> 20:44.290
I'll have to be ruthless
and force your hand.

20:44.590 --> 20:46.740
Let's see if you really intend

20:46.760 --> 20:48.030
never to look back.

21:06.100 --> 21:10.460
[Chen Yanyun] [Gu Jinzhao]

21:12.720 --> 21:14.630
[Chen Yanyun] [Gu Jinzhao]

21:19.480 --> 21:22.100
[Letter of Amicable Separation]

21:29.110 --> 21:30.000
Take this

21:31.440 --> 21:32.400
to Chen Yi

21:33.030 --> 21:34.150
and have him give it to Third Master.

21:34.150 --> 21:36.620
[To Third Master]

21:35.960 --> 21:36.550
My Lady,

21:37.400 --> 21:38.860
is this really necessary?

21:39.070 --> 21:40.960
Maybe we should wait a little longer.

21:40.960 --> 21:41.790
I have already

21:42.110 --> 21:43.310
waited for many days.

21:43.960 --> 21:45.560
I don't want to wait anymore.

21:46.680 --> 21:47.940
Since he clearly knows

21:48.070 --> 21:49.000
I'm not at fault,

21:49.680 --> 21:51.940
yet still makes things difficult for me,

21:52.070 --> 21:54.200
I naturally won't indulge him either.

21:56.790 --> 21:57.550
Yes.

22:20.680 --> 22:21.480
Third Master.

22:23.000 --> 22:23.960
Everything is ready?

22:23.960 --> 22:24.680
Yes, it's ready.

22:24.680 --> 22:25.210
Let's go.

22:26.240 --> 22:27.160
Oh right, Third Master.

22:27.160 --> 22:28.360
Qingpu brought this,

22:28.400 --> 22:29.590
a letter for you from Madam.

22:29.590 --> 22:30.110
Madam?

22:30.110 --> 22:30.550
Yes.

22:31.730 --> 22:33.660
[To Third Master]

22:40.250 --> 22:44.740
[Letter of Amicable Separation]

22:49.410 --> 22:54.660
[Letter of Amicable Separation]

22:58.400 --> 23:00.200
♪ Once I wrote of spring and fall ♪

23:00.810 --> 23:03.850
♪ Yet fell through time's abyss ♪

23:06.190 --> 23:07.660
♪ Every shade turned bitter ♪

23:08.400 --> 23:11.360
♪ Every longing became sorrow ♪

23:14.000 --> 23:15.510
♪ I've seen through right and wrong ♪

23:16.510 --> 23:19.760
♪ Old vows washed away like ash ♪

23:20.480 --> 23:26.920
♪ True devotion is knowing
the freedom within your heart♪

23:27.930 --> 23:30.770
♪ Word by word, hand in hand ♪

23:31.580 --> 23:34.480
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

23:35.400 --> 23:38.510
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

23:39.510 --> 23:41.870
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

23:43.400 --> 23:46.350
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

23:47.160 --> 23:50.120
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

23:51.000 --> 24:00.930
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

24:34.060 --> 24:36.050
[Linxia Restaurant]

24:47.810 --> 24:50.200
[Linxia Restaurant]

24:59.190 --> 25:00.900
Miss Zhao really knows
how to get things done.

25:00.900 --> 25:02.160
She even managed to invite all the wives

25:02.160 --> 25:03.270
of the Grand Secretaries.

25:03.270 --> 25:06.200
We won't have to worry about our business
from now on.

25:06.610 --> 25:08.610
I'm not worried about the business.

25:08.720 --> 25:10.720
I'm worried about my eldest sister.

25:23.320 --> 25:24.760
This tea smells so good.

25:25.200 --> 25:26.260
This is this year's

25:26.270 --> 25:27.600
first flush of Songluo.

25:27.640 --> 25:29.970
It was brewed with mountain spring water.

25:33.200 --> 25:35.060
This pattern leaves some margin.

25:35.200 --> 25:36.310
Madam, you can cut along

25:36.310 --> 25:38.920
the outer edge of the pattern
along with the fabric.

25:38.920 --> 25:39.640
As if I didn't know

25:39.640 --> 25:41.440
I need to cut it with the pattern!

25:41.920 --> 25:42.720
Exactly.

25:42.960 --> 25:44.490
It's just a piece of fabric.

25:44.550 --> 25:46.200
If it's ruined, it's ruined.

25:47.020 --> 25:48.960
What do you mean "if it's ruined,
it's ruined"?

25:48.960 --> 25:49.550
Are you saying

25:49.550 --> 25:50.810
I ruined it on purpose?

25:51.200 --> 25:51.590
I...

25:52.110 --> 25:53.710
We are cutting fabrics today

25:53.920 --> 25:56.240
to imitate the Empress Dowager

25:56.790 --> 25:59.590
and encourage the people
to plant mulberry trees.

25:59.640 --> 26:01.680
But if we ruin too many fabrics,

26:02.030 --> 26:04.310
it rather defeats the original purpose.

26:08.270 --> 26:09.600
I actually have an idea.

26:10.670 --> 26:11.910
The ruined fabric

26:12.070 --> 26:13.340
doesn't have to be thrown away.

26:13.340 --> 26:15.400
Have someone sew the pieces together

26:15.640 --> 26:17.070
to make patched blessing clothes

26:17.070 --> 26:19.350
and donate them to the children
at the Hall of Benevolence.

26:19.350 --> 26:20.790
That's a good idea.

26:22.400 --> 26:24.000
Madam Chen is truly clever.

26:24.310 --> 26:25.370
Now that you say it,

26:25.480 --> 26:27.440
we don't feel burdened anymore.

26:29.110 --> 26:30.340
In my opinion,

26:30.880 --> 26:33.340
Madam Chen's cleverness is only secondary.

26:33.720 --> 26:36.270
What matters most is her composure.

26:37.000 --> 26:38.260
If it were anyone else,

26:38.580 --> 26:40.960
with their Second Uncle
dismissed from office

26:40.960 --> 26:43.200
and their ancestral home
losing half its assets,

26:43.200 --> 26:45.070
they would have cried themselves to death.

26:45.070 --> 26:46.230
But Madam Chen

26:46.440 --> 26:48.090
remains calm and collected,

26:48.160 --> 26:49.680
even enjoying tea here.

26:53.590 --> 26:55.440
My Second Uncle broke the law.

26:55.750 --> 26:57.270
He deserved to be punished.

26:57.270 --> 26:59.070
What is there for me to cry about?

27:00.160 --> 27:01.480
Well said.

27:01.830 --> 27:02.880
Madam Chen really

27:02.880 --> 27:04.480
has seen her share of storms.

27:05.030 --> 27:06.030
I heard

27:06.440 --> 27:07.920
when Madam Chen was little,

27:07.920 --> 27:10.200
she was sent to her
maternal grandparents' house

27:10.200 --> 27:11.270
because

27:11.550 --> 27:12.640
her fate

27:13.000 --> 27:15.880
was supposedly hindering
her father's official career.

27:15.880 --> 27:18.410
I originally didn't believe in
these things.

27:18.480 --> 27:19.940
But thinking about it now,

27:20.440 --> 27:21.270
it's true.

27:22.110 --> 27:22.880
Your father

27:23.200 --> 27:24.590
was indeed demoted

27:24.590 --> 27:25.990
and sent out to Pingyang.

27:26.510 --> 27:28.110
This time, your Second Uncle

27:28.200 --> 27:29.400
was also dismissed.

27:30.070 --> 27:31.030
Could it be that

27:31.270 --> 27:32.870
this fortune-telling stuff

27:32.920 --> 27:34.400
actually makes sense?

27:35.680 --> 27:36.720
Madam Chen,

27:37.200 --> 27:38.640
you must be careful.

27:38.960 --> 27:41.420
It's one thing if it's your father
and uncle,

27:42.240 --> 27:43.970
but what if it affects Jiuheng?

27:47.720 --> 27:49.510
Why are you saying all this?

27:51.640 --> 27:53.160
I'm just joking.

27:57.160 --> 27:58.000
Mrs. Wang

27:58.000 --> 28:00.160
is deliberately causing trouble today,
isn't she?

28:00.160 --> 28:01.590
She is just angry.

28:02.550 --> 28:04.480
The investigation into the Gu Deyuan case
has reached this point.

28:04.480 --> 28:05.590
Over thirty court officials

28:05.590 --> 28:07.510
have been implicated
and thrown into prison.

28:07.510 --> 28:08.600
However,

28:08.790 --> 28:09.400
it hasn't involved Jiuheng

28:09.400 --> 28:10.790
in the slightest.

28:11.440 --> 28:13.000
But the matter of Wang Xuanfan

28:13.000 --> 28:14.830
colluding with the late Prince Chengqing

28:14.830 --> 28:16.760
is becoming more and more evident.

28:17.640 --> 28:18.400
I heard

28:18.480 --> 28:19.350
they have already found the family

28:19.350 --> 28:21.350
of the concubine who died suddenly.

28:25.680 --> 28:26.310
My Lady!

28:28.960 --> 28:29.510
My Lady!

28:30.960 --> 28:31.760
What's wrong?

28:32.480 --> 28:33.400
Today, Third Master

28:33.400 --> 28:35.080
went to Mount Yu to inspect Dingling tomb

28:35.080 --> 28:36.080
and was ambushed.

28:44.680 --> 28:45.240
My Lady!

28:48.680 --> 28:50.270
I was right, wasn't I?

28:56.400 --> 28:57.460
What are you doing?

28:59.240 --> 28:59.720
You...

29:02.070 --> 29:03.710
If our Master

29:03.790 --> 29:05.460
has any mishap today,

29:06.000 --> 29:07.210
I will hold you

29:07.230 --> 29:08.700
entirely responsible!

29:09.160 --> 29:11.290
You will answer for him with your life!

29:45.310 --> 29:46.030
Madam.

29:50.590 --> 29:51.750
I am incompetent.

29:52.440 --> 29:53.720
I failed to protect Third Master.

29:53.720 --> 29:55.120
Please punish me, Madam!

30:07.790 --> 30:08.310
My Lady!

30:30.400 --> 30:30.920
Mother,

30:31.400 --> 30:32.800
let's go back first.

30:33.270 --> 30:35.470
Let my sister-in-law stay with Yanyun.

30:44.750 --> 30:46.270
Why are your hands so cold?

30:51.000 --> 30:51.800
Third Master.

30:56.720 --> 30:57.960
Because we left in a hurry,

30:57.960 --> 30:59.890
Third Master only took me with him.

31:00.270 --> 31:02.270
Shortly after leaving the capital,

31:02.440 --> 31:04.240
we unexpectedly met assassins.

31:04.310 --> 31:05.510
They outnumbered us,

31:06.030 --> 31:08.160
and had archers ambushed in the woods.

31:11.110 --> 31:12.370
Do you suspect anyone?

31:13.030 --> 31:13.680
Yes.

31:15.270 --> 31:17.270
The whole Court is talking about it.

31:18.550 --> 31:19.950
They all say Wang Xuanfan

31:20.310 --> 31:22.570
was caught with evidence by Third Master

31:22.920 --> 31:24.180
and he hired assassins

31:25.510 --> 31:27.040
to kill him in desperation.

31:30.960 --> 31:33.730
[Wang Mansion]

31:31.480 --> 31:34.100
I did not assassinate Third Mr. Chen!

31:33.850 --> 31:38.910
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

31:34.400 --> 31:34.920
Master,

31:36.680 --> 31:38.000
Lord Wang Shenzhi, Chief Justice

31:38.000 --> 31:39.070
of the Imperial Court of Judicial Review,
is here.

31:39.070 --> 31:40.160
He said he wanted to ask

31:40.160 --> 31:41.640
about the assassination of

31:41.640 --> 31:42.720
Lord Chen Yanyun.

31:43.640 --> 31:44.680
Go tell him

31:45.160 --> 31:46.240
that I don't know who

31:46.240 --> 31:47.270
assassinated Chen Jiuheng.

31:47.270 --> 31:49.000
But it definitely wasn't me.

31:49.440 --> 31:50.240
Exactly!

31:50.750 --> 31:51.920
Does he have evidence?

31:51.920 --> 31:53.240
How dare he come asking?

31:53.240 --> 31:54.240
From what he said,

31:54.440 --> 31:56.240
it seems he might have evidence.

31:56.240 --> 31:56.960
I...

31:57.000 --> 31:58.430
I just received the news

31:58.640 --> 31:59.310
that one of the men

31:59.310 --> 32:00.680
we sent to spy on Chen Yanyun

32:00.680 --> 32:01.640
is missing.

32:07.000 --> 32:08.000
You may leave now.

32:08.070 --> 32:08.550
Yes.

32:18.510 --> 32:20.440
Why are you looking at me like that?

32:20.920 --> 32:21.920
Tell me the truth.

32:22.550 --> 32:23.710
Did you do it?

32:24.030 --> 32:25.880
It really wasn't me!

32:28.240 --> 32:28.770
It's true

32:29.270 --> 32:31.470
that I would love to kill Third Mr. Chen,

32:31.750 --> 32:33.680
but that breaks the rules.

32:33.880 --> 32:35.110
A Grand Secretary assassinating another

32:35.110 --> 32:36.510
is unprecedented.

32:38.110 --> 32:39.910
But everyone out there is saying

32:40.030 --> 32:41.750
you were afraid Third Mr. Chen
would produce

32:41.750 --> 32:43.830
evidence of your collusion
with Prince Chengqing,

32:43.830 --> 32:45.200
so you were backed into a corner
like a dog

32:45.200 --> 32:46.030
and hired an assassin.

32:46.030 --> 32:47.590
Who are you calling a dog?

32:47.880 --> 32:48.270
I...

32:54.000 --> 32:54.800
Everyone out?

32:58.160 --> 32:58.830
No, no.

33:00.110 --> 33:01.770
Someone is trying to frame me.

33:03.110 --> 33:03.910
Yes, yes, yes.

33:04.270 --> 33:04.730
This...

33:05.240 --> 33:06.750
This must be someone framing me!

33:06.750 --> 33:08.350
Who would dare to frame you?

33:08.790 --> 33:09.650
Third Mr. Chen?

33:10.640 --> 33:12.070
I've asked around.

33:12.400 --> 33:14.060
He really got shot by an arrow.

33:14.350 --> 33:15.610
The injury is serious.

33:22.880 --> 33:23.830
Could it be...

33:25.000 --> 33:26.480
Could it be

33:27.160 --> 33:28.760
the Senior Grand Secretary?

33:32.790 --> 33:33.520
Impossible.

33:34.350 --> 33:35.400
Absolutely impossible.

33:35.400 --> 33:37.110
The Senior Grand Secretary still needs me.

33:37.110 --> 33:38.840
He will definitely protect me.

33:39.200 --> 33:40.530
Third Mr. Chen's tricks

33:41.000 --> 33:41.730
are useless.

33:42.200 --> 33:43.400
Definitely useless.

34:53.630 --> 34:55.320
Why are you crying like this?

35:06.840 --> 35:07.670
Don't worry.

35:09.320 --> 35:10.320
I won't die.

35:16.800 --> 35:18.440
How can I not worry?

35:19.230 --> 35:20.700
You bled so much,

35:20.800 --> 35:22.660
and were unconscious for so long.

35:22.840 --> 35:25.040
It's my first time seeing you like this.

35:25.440 --> 35:26.470
Don't ever

35:26.590 --> 35:27.990
scare me like this again!

35:33.190 --> 35:34.590
How do you feel now?

35:36.150 --> 35:37.110
Just so-so.

35:41.510 --> 35:42.640
Then rest yourself.

35:43.510 --> 35:45.110
I won't disturb you anymore.

35:45.360 --> 35:46.110
Come back!

35:56.630 --> 35:57.370
Sit.

35:58.030 --> 35:58.710
I won't sit!

35:59.510 --> 36:01.110
Just say what you want to say.

36:04.710 --> 36:06.300
Why are you so stubborn?

36:06.760 --> 36:08.220
Because you make me angry.

36:10.070 --> 36:12.130
You were the one who wanted a divorce.

36:12.440 --> 36:13.440
Why are you angry?

36:14.360 --> 36:15.540
Why am I angry?

36:15.880 --> 36:16.630
Chen Yanyun!

36:17.030 --> 36:18.830
You have some nerve saying that!

36:18.880 --> 36:20.210
Why did I want a divorce?

36:20.590 --> 36:22.190
It was all because you ignored me.

36:22.190 --> 36:23.450
You treated me coldly,

36:23.480 --> 36:24.760
staying in the Hall of Literary Profundity
all day

36:24.760 --> 36:26.020
and never coming home!

36:26.800 --> 36:27.400
It was you

36:27.400 --> 36:28.670
who didn't want to be with me anymore,

36:28.670 --> 36:30.130
yet you put the blame on me.

36:30.760 --> 36:32.550
Are all you Grand Secretaries like this?

36:32.550 --> 36:34.190
No wonder the people of Great Yan

36:34.190 --> 36:35.450
are in dire suffering.

36:36.000 --> 36:38.200
I didn't stay away from home
on purpose.

36:39.590 --> 36:41.070
I was angry that you knew clearly

36:41.070 --> 36:42.870
about Chen Xuanqing's treason,

36:43.880 --> 36:44.320
yet...

36:47.670 --> 36:49.000
yet you didn't tell me.

36:50.190 --> 36:51.400
Tell you?

36:52.480 --> 36:53.480
You tell me.

36:54.000 --> 36:55.260
If you were in my shoes,

36:55.400 --> 36:56.460
what would you say?

36:59.320 --> 37:01.110
Just speak openly.

37:02.150 --> 37:03.810
Say that you and Chen Xuanqing

37:04.880 --> 37:06.280
had a past.

37:07.290 --> 37:08.870
No, it's a relationship.

37:09.840 --> 37:11.030
Just say that you and Chen Xuanqing

37:11.030 --> 37:12.160
had a relationship.

37:13.400 --> 37:15.360
It started from the coming-of-age
ceremony,

37:15.360 --> 37:18.110
and stopped abruptly
before the metropolitan examination.

37:18.110 --> 37:19.920
That is a matter of the past.

37:20.670 --> 37:21.920
But Chen Xuanqing

37:22.400 --> 37:23.530
keeps pestering you

37:23.760 --> 37:24.960
time and again.

37:30.960 --> 37:32.070
You can't do this.

37:39.480 --> 37:41.080
You are being unreasonable.

37:42.000 --> 37:43.930
Has being reasonable ever worked?

37:46.070 --> 37:47.630
Since you have investigated

37:47.630 --> 37:48.190
the ins and outs of this matter

37:48.190 --> 37:49.280
so clearly,

37:50.000 --> 37:51.800
do I still need to be reasonable?

37:52.360 --> 37:53.620
Would you even listen?

37:57.550 --> 37:59.150
I know I shouldn't blame you.

38:00.630 --> 38:01.760
I am just angry

38:02.960 --> 38:04.240
that you actually

38:04.320 --> 38:05.840
pursued another man.

38:06.510 --> 38:08.190
And that man wasn't me.

38:09.230 --> 38:10.640
I'm angry at myself too,

38:11.070 --> 38:12.530
for not realizing earlier

38:13.760 --> 38:15.030
my feelings for you.

38:17.740 --> 38:19.590
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

38:20.410 --> 38:21.920
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

38:23.380 --> 38:26.660
♪ Year after year,
it etches your likeness ♪

38:27.670 --> 38:29.770
♪ Count the faint shimmer
of the starry river ♪

38:31.070 --> 38:34.590
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

38:35.700 --> 38:37.540
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

38:38.540 --> 38:40.130
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

38:41.170 --> 38:45.660
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

38:46.810 --> 38:50.460
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

38:52.500 --> 38:56.340
♪ For all the days of our lives,
our love will endure ♪

38:54.800 --> 38:56.440
Where did you learn all this?

38:57.280 --> 38:59.540
Directly from you, the Grand Secretary.

39:00.920 --> 39:02.630
What's wrong? Does it hurt again?

39:02.630 --> 39:04.090
I'll go get the physician.

39:05.400 --> 39:06.060
Don't move.

39:06.930 --> 39:08.660
Let me hold you a little longer.

39:13.760 --> 39:14.560
Third Master!

39:16.880 --> 39:17.710
What is it?

39:18.110 --> 39:18.920
The Court of Judicial Review,

39:18.920 --> 39:20.030
based on the clues we left,

39:20.030 --> 39:21.230
has already found the men

39:21.230 --> 39:22.890
Wang Xuanfan sent to spy on us.

39:23.000 --> 39:24.280
Then have the men

39:25.880 --> 39:27.280
keeping an eye on Wang Xuanfan's residence

39:27.280 --> 39:28.230
withdraw.

39:29.110 --> 39:30.190
We don't want them getting discovered

39:30.190 --> 39:31.880
and ruining our plan.

39:32.150 --> 39:33.030
As for the rest,

39:33.960 --> 39:35.070
we'll wait and see.

39:35.480 --> 39:35.920
Yes.

39:38.280 --> 39:39.030
So,

39:39.840 --> 39:41.230
was this assassination really

39:41.230 --> 39:42.630
the doing of Wang Xuanfan?

39:42.630 --> 39:45.110
Truth and falsehood mix,

39:46.280 --> 39:47.880
making it impossible to tell

39:48.360 --> 39:49.960
what is real and what is fake.

39:51.710 --> 39:53.170
You're being mysterious.

39:57.580 --> 40:00.130
[A Heart of Purity and Loftiness]

40:10.360 --> 40:11.890
If you have anything to ask,

40:12.190 --> 40:12.920
just ask.

40:13.800 --> 40:15.330
About this assassination,

40:15.480 --> 40:16.810
what exactly happened?

40:18.880 --> 40:21.010
I really can't hide anything from you.

40:21.190 --> 40:23.250
So, it was actually faked?

40:25.960 --> 40:26.880
Does it hurt again?

40:26.880 --> 40:28.580
Oh, my dear.

40:29.800 --> 40:31.400
The assassination was fake,

40:31.550 --> 40:32.880
but the wound is real.

40:35.030 --> 40:36.050
You did this

40:36.070 --> 40:37.870
just to bring down Wang Xuanfan?

40:38.000 --> 40:39.070
Wang Xuanfan and I

40:39.230 --> 40:40.680
are completely at odds.

40:40.800 --> 40:42.000
He had people tail me,

40:42.000 --> 40:44.130
which was already breaking the rules.

40:44.800 --> 40:46.670
So I just played along

40:47.110 --> 40:48.310
and put on a full show.

40:49.590 --> 40:50.320
Since

40:50.510 --> 40:51.960
this assassination was fake,

40:51.960 --> 40:53.560
why did you get hurt so badly?

40:54.070 --> 40:55.670
It was all because you sent me

40:56.000 --> 40:58.730
the Letter of Amicable Separation
this morning.

41:00.190 --> 41:01.480
You saw the Letter of Amicable Separation

41:01.480 --> 41:03.280
and didn't even dodge the arrow?

41:03.400 --> 41:05.060
I didn't want to live anymore.

41:05.800 --> 41:07.190
What nonsense are you talking about?

41:07.190 --> 41:07.920
I wanted a divorce,

41:07.920 --> 41:09.120
not to become a widow!

41:10.070 --> 41:10.760
It hurts.

41:11.480 --> 41:12.010
It hurts.

41:13.440 --> 41:14.550
Does it hurt again?

41:16.760 --> 41:17.670
It hurts.

41:21.280 --> 41:23.010
Do you still want to divorce me?

41:24.480 --> 41:25.340
No, I don't.

41:31.400 --> 41:32.200
Third Master.

41:33.590 --> 41:36.450
The Senior Grand Secretary
has arrived at the gate.

41:41.400 --> 41:42.550
The Senior Grand Secretary...

41:42.550 --> 41:44.670
He probably didn't come
to see about your injury, did he?

41:44.670 --> 41:45.600
Definitely not.

41:46.510 --> 41:47.710
He is most likely here

41:47.920 --> 41:49.550
to plead for Wang Xuanfan.

42:06.880 --> 42:08.310
Another half inch,

42:08.400 --> 42:10.130
and it would have hit the heart.

42:10.280 --> 42:13.400
Lord Chen, you are indeed fortunate.

42:14.150 --> 42:15.920
Glad you are fine.

42:16.510 --> 42:19.000
I'll go write the prescription then.

42:21.630 --> 42:22.360
Come with me.

42:39.030 --> 42:39.720
I'm fine.

42:39.880 --> 42:41.410
Please have a seat, Mentor.

42:43.630 --> 42:45.090
Imperial Physician Zhou,

42:45.150 --> 42:46.510
in terms of treating external injuries,

42:46.510 --> 42:47.560
is unparalleled

42:47.710 --> 42:48.480
in

42:49.230 --> 42:50.960
the Imperial Medical Academy.

42:51.760 --> 42:53.290
I have worried you, Mentor.

42:56.280 --> 42:58.960
Seeing you so seriously injured,

43:00.840 --> 43:02.480
I'll get straight to the point

43:02.480 --> 43:03.880
with my questions.

43:05.880 --> 43:07.440
Was it truly Wang Xuanfan

43:09.000 --> 43:10.860
who sent the assassins after you?

43:12.320 --> 43:13.480
I heard that

43:14.150 --> 43:14.960
all the men

43:15.110 --> 43:16.920
Wang Xuanfan sent to watch me

43:17.030 --> 43:18.550
have been captured

43:19.000 --> 43:19.480
and

43:20.510 --> 43:21.910
they have all confessed.

43:27.510 --> 43:29.070
How much do you actually know

43:29.070 --> 43:31.280
about Wang Xuanfan's collusion

43:31.400 --> 43:33.320
with the late Prince Chengqing?

43:34.150 --> 43:35.000
Actually,

43:35.670 --> 43:37.360
I wouldn't dare hide it from you, Mentor.

43:37.360 --> 43:39.090
I truly don't know much either.

43:39.110 --> 43:40.110
What I said

43:40.110 --> 43:41.230
in Court back then

43:41.480 --> 43:43.480
was just a bluff to rattle Yuanweng.

43:43.630 --> 43:44.430
I thought that

43:44.840 --> 43:45.920
if provoked,

43:45.920 --> 43:48.000
he would definitely give himself away.

43:48.000 --> 43:48.730
Sure enough,

43:50.360 --> 43:51.960
he actually sent assassins

43:51.960 --> 43:53.110
to kill me.

43:53.840 --> 43:56.450
A Grand Secretary assassinating
another Grand Secretary...

43:56.450 --> 43:58.540
Truly appalling.

43:59.920 --> 44:02.120
I couldn't believe it before either,

44:02.230 --> 44:04.670
but to bring down Fan Chuan, Yuanweng

44:05.110 --> 44:07.000
replaced the grain with bran,

44:07.360 --> 44:08.360
disregarding

44:08.590 --> 44:10.070
the lives of hundreds of thousands of
famine victims

44:10.070 --> 44:10.880
in Pingyang.

44:11.800 --> 44:12.960
Since then,

44:13.510 --> 44:14.510
I feel like

44:15.400 --> 44:16.960
anything he does

44:17.510 --> 44:19.240
wouldn't surprise me anymore.

44:20.360 --> 44:21.560
So about this matter,

44:21.630 --> 44:22.630
you still

44:22.880 --> 44:24.960
hold a grudge.

44:29.710 --> 44:31.400
But there was a reason.

44:32.070 --> 44:33.000
Doing this

44:33.000 --> 44:35.260
makes you seem rather petty, doesn't it?

44:39.110 --> 44:41.280
Mentor, this summer is a bit long,

44:42.230 --> 44:44.230
and the summer flood is very severe.

44:45.230 --> 44:48.110
Officials from the River Conservancy Office
reported

44:48.110 --> 44:49.960
that in the lower reaches
of the Huaihe River,

44:49.960 --> 44:51.620
there are a full twenty-three

44:51.710 --> 44:52.910
riverbank breaches.

44:53.230 --> 44:54.150
Yes.

44:56.110 --> 44:57.150
It's hard.

44:58.190 --> 44:59.780
Fifteen breaches

44:59.920 --> 45:02.070
were not caused by fierce floods

45:02.400 --> 45:04.260
or the river changing its course,

45:04.280 --> 45:05.190
but because of

45:05.710 --> 45:06.840
cutting corners

45:07.150 --> 45:08.480
in river construction.

45:08.880 --> 45:10.320
The wood used for flood control

45:10.320 --> 45:11.320
was all rotten.

45:12.070 --> 45:12.920
Among them,

45:13.670 --> 45:15.870
the chief administrators in six places

45:15.880 --> 45:17.540
are Wang Xuanfan's students.

45:23.590 --> 45:25.710
Wang Xuanfan has gone

45:28.880 --> 45:30.000
too far!

45:36.960 --> 45:38.150
The other nine

45:39.480 --> 45:41.590
are all under you, my mentor's name.

46:01.790 --> 46:05.510
[A Splendid Match]
